<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank J. Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued 40 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Novartis AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 500 warrants.  STRIKE PRICE    2,250 CHF		 PREMIUM	16.45 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.44 CHF		  GEARING	9.64 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.JUN.97-20.NOV.98   PAYDATE	25.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,120 CHF  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  JVCM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
